### Variables Globales
@host = http://localhost:3000

# ==============================================================================
# Módulo de Logs y Observabilidad del Cliente
# Permite al frontend reportar excepciones, fallos de render y promesas rechazadas
# para que se guarden en logs/app-YYYY-MM-DD.log y sean indexados por Filebeat/Elasticsearch.
# ==============================================================================

### 1. Registrar Error de Cliente (Frontend)
POST {{host}}/api/logs/client
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'map')",
  "source": "error-boundary",
  "url": "http://localhost:3000/sales",
  "componentStack": "in SalesTable (at page.tsx:126)\nin SalesPage (at page.tsx:64)",
  "stack": "TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'map')\n    at SalesTable (webpack-internal:///(app-pages-browser)/./components/organisms/SalesTable.tsx:45:21)",
  "metadata": {
    "view": "sales",
    "filter": "completada"
  }
}

### 2. Error con Payload Inválido (Debe devolver 400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/logs/client
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "custom"
}
